* {{rhymes|is|ɪːcɪtl|s=2}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun/old|m|lykils|lyklar}}

# a [[key]]
#: {{ux|is|Ekki gleyma '''lyklunum''' þegar þú ferð út.|Don't forget '''the keys''' on your way out.}}
